OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788713294
OL,3,CInvestigation opens into alleged
OL,4,Cassault involving football player and
OL,5,Cfan
OL,7,FAn investigation has opened into an
OL,8,Falleged common assault involving a
OL,9,Ffootball player and fan at a Cardiff
OL,10,FCity away football match.
OL,12,FThe incident occured yesterday
OL,13,F(Saturday 5 September) at Fratton Park
OL,14,Fin Portsmouth.
OL,16,FIt is understood that the alleged
OL,17,Faltercation involved Cardiff City
OL,18,Fdefender Krystian Bielik and a teenage
OL,19,Fboy, who was reportedly the victim of
OL,20,Fa common assault.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
