PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788713294
OL,3,CInvestigation opens into alleged
OL,4,Cassault involving football player and
OL,5,Cfan
OL,7,FVideo footage of the incident shows
OL,8,Fthe Cardiff City defender becoming
OL,9,Finvolved in the alleged altercation
OL,10,Fwith the young male supporter, who
OL,11,Fcaught the ball and then appeared to
OL,12,Fbe pushed in the throat by the player
OL,13,Fafter he had thrown it back towards
OL,14,Fthe pitch.
OL,16,FCardiff City FC said it is aware of a
OL,17,F"confrontation between a small section
OL,18,Fof Portsmouth supporters and Krystian
OL,19,FBielik at Fratton Park yesterday".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
