PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788713294
OL,3,CInvestigation opens into alleged
OL,4,Cassault involving football player and
OL,5,Cfan
OL,7,FIt continues: "We are satisfied with
OL,8,Fthe way that match officials dealt
OL,9,Fwith the situation during the game,
OL,10,Fhaving been in full view of it. Player
OL,11,Fprotection will always be of paramount
OL,12,Fimportance to us.
OL,14,F"It is understood that due process
OL,15,Fwill be undertaken following the
OL,16,Fsubmission of the referee's report to
OL,17,Fthe Football Association. As such it
OL,18,Fwould not be appropriate to comment
OL,19,Ffurther on the matter at this time."
