OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788713294
OL,3,CInvestigation opens into alleged
OL,4,Cassault involving football player and
OL,5,Cfan
OL,7,FPortsmouth FC said it is also aware of
OL,8,Fthe incident and concerns some fans
OL,9,Fmay have.
OL,11,FIt continues: "As this remains a
OL,12,Fsafeguarding matter and is currently
OL,13,Funder investigation by both the club
OL,14,Fand the police, it would be
OL,15,Finappropriate for us to comment
OL,16,Ffurther on the circumstances at this
OL,17,Ftime.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
