PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788713294
OL,3,CInvestigation opens into alleged
OL,4,Cassault involving football player and
OL,5,Cfan
OL,7,F"However, we are aware that a number
OL,8,Fof claims and assertions are
OL,9,Fcirculating on social media. We would
OL,10,Furge caution against speculation while
OL,11,Fenquiries are ongoing.
OL,13,F"The welfare and safeguarding of young
OL,14,Fpeople are of paramount importance to
OL,15,FPortsmouth Football Club. We will
OL,16,Fcontinue to liaise with the relevant
OL,17,Fparties as enquiries progress".
