OL,3,CInvestigation opens into alleged
OL,4,Cassault involving football player and
OL,5,Cfan
OL,7,FHampshire Police said: "We can confirm
OL,8,Fthat we are investigating an incident
OL,9,Fin which a teenage boy was reportedly
OL,10,Fthe victim of a common assault during
OL,11,Fyesterday's (Saturday 5 September)
OL,12,Ffootball match at Fratton Park. Our
OL,13,Fenquiries are ongoing."
